+
+Do not return arbitrary files outside task artifacts/runs.
+
+#### `PATCH /api/tasks/<task_id>/config`
+
+Payload:
+
+```json
+{
+  "max_iterations": 5,
+  "test_commands": ["python -m unittest discover -s tests"]
+}
